    "Inkvolt PDF has no AI of its own. If you want one, connect a model you run (Ollama, LM Studio) or an OpenAI-compatible service you have an account with. Only text you pick is sent, after you see it, to the endpoint below. Bermudez Systems receives nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inkvolt PDF no tiene IA propia. Si quieres una, conecta un modelo que ejecutes (Ollama, LM Studio) o un servicio compatible con OpenAI en el que tengas una cuenta. Solo se envía el texto que elijas, después de verlo, al punto de conexión de abajo. Bermudez Systems no recibe nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inkvolt PDF makes PDFs from Office files with LibreOffice, which isn't installed on this Mac. LibreOffice is free, from libreoffice.org.": {
