    },
    "Inkvolt PDF makes PDFs from Office files with LibreOffice, which isn't installed on this Mac; it can't use {0} yet. Open the file in {0} and save it as PDF there, or install LibreOffice. LibreOffice is free, from libreoffice.org.": {
